       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BANKMSG.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-CUSTOMER-NAME PIC X(20).
       01 WS-ACCOUNT-NO PIC X(10).
       01 WS-TRAN-TYPE PIC X(10).
       01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(7).
       01 WS-REFERENCE PIC X(12).
       01 WS-AMOUNT-TEXT PIC X(7).
       01 WS-MESSAGE PIC X(100).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "ENTER CUSTOMER NAME:"
           ACCEPT WS-CUSTOMER-NAME
           DISPLAY "ENTER ACCOUNT NUMBER:"
           ACCEPT WS-ACCOUNT-NO
           DISPLAY "ENTER TRANSACTION TYPE:"
           ACCEPT WS-TRAN-TYPE
           DISPLAY "ENTER TRANSACTION AMOUNT:"
           ACCEPT WS-AMOUNT
           DISPLAY "ENTER REFERENCE NUMBER:"
           ACCEPT WS-REFERENCE
           MOVE WS-AMOUNT TO WS-AMOUNT-TEXT
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-MESSAGE       
           STRING
               "CUSTOMER: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CUSTOMER-NAME)
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " | ACCOUNT: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-ACCOUNT-NO DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " | TYPE: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TRAN-TYPE)
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " | AMOUNT: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-AMOUNT-TEXT DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " | REF: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               FUNCTION TRIM(WS-REFERENCE)
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO WS-MESSAGE
           END-STRING

           DISPLAY "TRANSACTION CONFIRMATION"
           DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-MESSAGE)
           STOP RUN.